        "Content": "Please make an application at www.anthonybyrne.ie/tenantapplicationform ONLY*\nPlease make an application at www.anthonybyrne.ie/tenantapplicationform ONLY*\nPlease make an application at www.anthonybyrne.ie/tenantapplicationform ONLY*\n\nStunning High Standard 2 Bedroom Home with Private Garden and Parking in Ardee.\n\nA rencent refurbishment to the highest of standards. A two bedroom, two bathroom home located in one of Ardee?s most convenient and sought after residential areas. This property offers exceptional comfort, modern design, and a full suite of premium features ideal for professionals, couples, or small families seeking a high quality home.\n\nProperty Features\nRecent refurbishment\nTriple glazing and air to water heat pump\nTwo spacious double bedrooms with excellent natural light\nUnderfloor heating\nThree modern bathrooms, including one ensuite\nContemporary kitchen with integrated appliances and generous storage\nPrivate rear garden\nRear access and off street parking\nHigh quality flooring and finishes throughout\nQuiet, mature residential setting\n\nLocation\nSituated within easy reach of Ardee town centre, local schools, shops, cafes, and amenities.\nClose to the M1 and N2 routes for fast access to Drogheda, Dundalk, and Dublin.\nRegular bus services connecting to surrounding towns.\n\nThis home offers the perfect blend of modern living, privacy, and convenience in a thriving Mid Louth location.\n\nAvailability\nReady for immediate occupation.\n\nProperty will be let as seen.\n\nPlease make an application at https://www.anthonybyrne.ie/tenantapplicationform ONLY*\n\nPlease note applicants or enquiries for properties advertised TO LET will NOT be accepted over the phone. Prospective tenants can only apply for properties TO LET by completing a tenant application form on our website using the link above.\n\nApplications that are not made through our website will not be processed."
